msgid "[Readonly classes](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.basic.php#language.oop5.basic.class.readonly)"
msgstr "[Classes readonly](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.basic.php#language.oop5.basic.class.readonly)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "[Constructor property promotion](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.decon.php#language.oop5.decon.constructor.promotion)"
msgstr "[Promoção de propriedades no construtor](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.decon.php#language.oop5.decon.constructor.promotion)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "[Attributes](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.attributes.php)"
msgstr "[Atributos](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.attributes.php)"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Run static analysis and tests on Yii 2.0 before reusing code in Yii3. Code with explicit types, small services, and few implicit `Yii::$app` dependencies is easier to understand and easier to place in the new application."
msgstr "Rode análise estática e testes no Yii 2.0 antes de reutilizar código no Yii3. Código com tipos explícitos, serviços pequenos e poucas dependências implícitas de `Yii::$app` é mais fácil de entender e de encaixar na nova aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 applications commonly keep framework roles in top-level directories:"
msgstr "Aplicações Yii 2.0 costumam manter os papéis do framework em diretórios de primeiro nível:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"assets/\n"
"commands/\n"
"config/\n"
"controllers/\n"
"models/\n"
"runtime/\n"
"views/\n"
"web/\n"
"widgets/\n"
msgstr ""
"assets/\n"
"commands/\n"
"config/\n"
"controllers/\n"
"models/\n"
"runtime/\n"
"views/\n"
"web/\n"
"widgets/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The Yii 2.0 advanced template splits the same roles by application:"
msgstr "O template advanced do Yii 2.0 divide os mesmos papéis por aplicação:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"backend/\n"
"common/\n"
"console/\n"
"frontend/\n"
msgstr ""
"backend/\n"
"common/\n"
"console/\n"
"frontend/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The current Yii3 application template is organized around source code, configuration, public files, and runtime files:"
msgstr "O template de aplicação atual do Yii3 é organizado em torno do código-fonte, da configuração, dos arquivos públicos e dos arquivos de runtime:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Yii 2.0 basic | Yii 2.0 advanced | Yii3 |\n"
"|---------------|------------------|------|\n"
"| `controllers/` | `frontend/controllers/`, `backend/controllers/` | `src/Web/*/Action.php` or controller-like classes |\n"
"| `models/` | `common/models/`, app-specific models | `src/Domain`, `src/Shared`, `src/Web/*`, or `src/Db` by responsibility |\n"
"| `views/` | `frontend/views/`, `backend/views/` | templates near the feature, for example `src/Web/HomePage/template.php` |\n"
"| `views/layouts/` | app layout directories | layout classes/templates, for example `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main` |\n"
"| `assets/` | app asset bundles | `assets/` for source files and `src/Web/.../*Asset.php` for bundles |\n"
"| `web/` | `frontend/web/`, `backend/web/` | `public/` |\n"
"| `commands/` | `console/controllers/` | `src/Console/*Command.php` |\n"
"| `config/*.php` | app and common config files | `config/common`, `config/web`, `config/console`, `config/environments` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Yii 2.0 basic | Yii 2.0 advanced | Yii3 |\n"
"|---------------|------------------|------|\n"
"| `controllers/` | `frontend/controllers/`, `backend/controllers/` | `src/Web/*/Action.php` ou classes no estilo controller |\n"
"| `models/` | `common/models/`, models específicos de cada app | `src/Domain`, `src/Shared`, `src/Web/*` ou `src/Db`, conforme a responsabilidade |\n"
"| `views/` | `frontend/views/`, `backend/views/` | templates perto da funcionalidade, por exemplo `src/Web/HomePage/template.php` |\n"
"| `views/layouts/` | diretórios de layout de cada app | classes/templates de layout, por exemplo `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main` |\n"
"| `assets/` | asset bundles de cada app | `assets/` para os arquivos-fonte e `src/Web/.../*Asset.php` para os bundles |\n"
"| `web/` | `frontend/web/`, `backend/web/` | `public/` |\n"
"| `commands/` | `console/controllers/` | `src/Console/*Command.php` |\n"
"| `config/*.php` | arquivos de configuração do app e comuns | `config/common`, `config/web`, `config/console`, `config/environments` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "There is no single required layout. The important change is that Yii3 applications should group code by responsibility and make dependencies explicit. If you are coming from the advanced template, treat `frontend` and `backend` as separate web contexts. Shared domain code can live in `src/Shared` or in application-specific packages."
msgstr "Não existe um layout obrigatório único. A mudança importante é que aplicações Yii3 devem agrupar o código por responsabilidade e tornar as dependências explícitas. Se você vem do template advanced, trate `frontend` e `backend` como contextos web separados. O código de domínio compartilhado pode ficar em `src/Shared` ou em pacotes específicos da aplicação."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Composer and autoloading"
msgstr "Composer e autoloading"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 applications usually require `vendor/autoload.php` and `vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php` in `web/index.php`.  Yii3 applications require only Composer's autoloader and application bootstrap code."
msgstr "Aplicações Yii 2.0 geralmente fazem require de `vendor/autoload.php` e `vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php` em `web/index.php`.  Aplicações Yii3 precisam apenas do autoloader do Composer e do código de bootstrap da aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Then rebuild Composer autoload files:"
msgstr "Depois, reconstrua os arquivos de autoload do Composer:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Install Yii3 packages intentionally. Yii3 is split into focused packages, so features such as database access, forms, validation, assets, data widgets, authentication, and caching are separate Composer dependencies."
msgstr "Instale os pacotes Yii3 de forma intencional. O Yii3 é dividido em pacotes focados, então funcionalidades como acesso ao banco de dados, formulários, validação, assets, widgets de dados, autenticação e cache são dependências separadas do Composer."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration and services"
msgstr "Configuração e serviços"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii 2.0, many services are configured as application components and accessed through the service locator:"
msgstr "No Yii 2.0, muitos serviços são configurados como componentes da aplicação e acessados pelo service locator:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$cache = Yii::$app->cache;\n"
"$db = Yii::$app->db;\n"
"$url = Yii::$app->urlManager->createUrl(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"
msgstr ""
"$cache = Yii::$app->cache;\n"
"$db = Yii::$app->db;\n"
"$url = Yii::$app->urlManager->createUrl(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, services are configured for the container and injected where they are needed:"
msgstr "No Yii3, os serviços são configurados no container e injetados onde são necessários:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostService\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ConnectionInterface $db,\n"
"        private CacheInterface $cache,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostService\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ConnectionInterface $db,\n"
"        private CacheInterface $cache,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Move configuration in groups:"
msgstr "Mova a configuração por grupos:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "aliases to `config/common/aliases.php`;"
msgstr "aliases para `config/common/aliases.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "route definitions to `config/common/routes.php`;"
msgstr "definições de rotas para `config/common/routes.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "shared service definitions to `config/common/di/*.php`;"
msgstr "definições de serviços compartilhadas para `config/common/di/*.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "web-only service definitions to `config/web/di/*.php`;"
msgstr "definições de serviços apenas para web para `config/web/di/*.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "console parameters and commands to `config/console/*.php`;"
msgstr "parâmetros e comandos de console para `config/console/*.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "shared parameters to `config/common/params.php`;"
msgstr "parâmetros compartilhados para `config/common/params.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "environment overrides to `config/environments`."
msgstr "sobrescritas por ambiente para `config/environments`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The default template's `di-console` group reuses shared definitions from `config/common/di/*.php`. If you need console-only container definitions, add the corresponding files to the `di-console` group in `config/configuration.php` and rebuild the merge plan."
msgstr "O grupo `di-console` do template padrão reutiliza as definições compartilhadas de `config/common/di/*.php`. Se você precisar de definições de container apenas para o console, adicione os arquivos correspondentes ao grupo `di-console` em `config/configuration.php` e reconstrua o merge plan."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entry script and bootstrap"
msgstr "Script de entrada e bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "A Yii 2.0 basic entry script commonly creates the application directly:"
msgstr "Um script de entrada do template basic do Yii 2.0 geralmente cria a aplicação diretamente:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"defined('YII_DEBUG') or define('YII_DEBUG', true);\n"
"defined('YII_ENV') or define('YII_ENV', 'dev');\n"
"\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/autoload.php';\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php';\n"
"\n"
"$config = require __DIR__ . '/../config/web.php';\n"
"\n"
"(new yii\\web\\Application($config))->run();\n"
msgstr ""
"defined('YII_DEBUG') or define('YII_DEBUG', true);\n"
"defined('YII_ENV') or define('YII_ENV', 'dev');\n"
"\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/autoload.php';\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php';\n"
"\n"
"$config = require __DIR__ . '/../config/web.php';\n"
"\n"
"(new yii\\web\\Application($config))->run();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, use the application template entry script as the source of truth. It loads Composer and bootstraps the configured application runner. Avoid recreating the old `yii\\web\\Application` pattern in `public/index.php`; put configuration in config files and dependencies in the container."
msgstr "No Yii3, use o script de entrada do template de aplicação como fonte da verdade. Ele carrega o Composer e inicializa o runner da aplicação configurada. Evite recriar o antigo padrão `yii\\web\\Application` em `public/index.php`; coloque a configuração nos arquivos de configuração e as dependências no container."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Controllers, actions, and routing"
msgstr "Controllers, actions e roteamento"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 routes usually point to controller action methods:"
msgstr "As rotas do Yii 2.0 geralmente apontam para métodos de action de controllers:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace app\\controllers;\n"
"\n"
"use yii\\web\\Controller;\n"
"\n"
"final class SiteController extends Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionIndex(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->render('index');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace app\\controllers;\n"
"\n"
"use yii\\web\\Controller;\n"
"\n"
"final class SiteController extends Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionIndex(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->render('index');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 does not require controller base classes. The current application template uses invokable action classes:"
msgstr "O Yii3 não exige classes base de controller. O template de aplicação atual usa classes de action invocáveis:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace App\\Web\\HomePage;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\WebViewRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private WebViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/template');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace App\\Web\\HomePage;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\WebViewRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private WebViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/template');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Routes are explicit:"
msgstr "As rotas são explícitas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "When redesigning a controller flow, list all Yii 2.0 actions and create named routes for the flows you still need.  Then implement each flow as an invokable class or a controller-like service. Constructor injection replaces calls to `Yii::$app` and controller properties."
msgstr "Ao redesenhar o fluxo de um controller, liste todas as actions do Yii 2.0 e crie rotas nomeadas para os fluxos de que você ainda precisa.  Depois, implemente cada fluxo como uma classe invocável ou um serviço no estilo controller. A injeção pelo construtor substitui as chamadas a `Yii::$app` e as propriedades do controller."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requests, responses, sessions, and cookies"
msgstr "Requisições, respostas, sessões e cookies"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 actions often read request data and write response data through application components:"
msgstr "As actions do Yii 2.0 frequentemente leem os dados da requisição e escrevem os dados da resposta por meio de componentes da aplicação:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$id = Yii::$app->request->get('id');\n"
"Yii::$app->session->setFlash('success', 'Saved.');\n"
"\n"
"return $this->redirect(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"
msgstr ""
"$id = Yii::$app->request->get('id');\n"
"Yii::$app->session->setFlash('success', 'Saved.');\n"
"\n"
"return $this->redirect(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 uses PSR-7 request and response objects and injectable services:"
msgstr "O Yii3 usa objetos de requisição e resposta PSR-7 e serviços injetáveis:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Status;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class SavePostAction\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $id = (int) ($request->getQueryParams()['id'] ?? 0);\n"
"        $url = $this->urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $id]);\n"
"\n"
"        return $this->responseFactory\n"
"            ->createResponse(Status::SEE_OTHER)\n"
"            ->withHeader('Location', $url);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Status;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class SavePostAction\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $id = (int) ($request->getQueryParams()['id'] ?? 0);\n"
"        $url = $this->urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $id]);\n"
"\n"
"        return $this->responseFactory\n"
"            ->createResponse(Status::SEE_OTHER)\n"
"            ->withHeader('Location', $url);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Design request handling early because it affects forms, filters, REST endpoints, redirects, and tests."
msgstr "Pense no tratamento de requisições logo no início, porque ele afeta formulários, filtros, endpoints REST, redirecionamentos e testes."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Views, layouts, assets, and URLs"
msgstr "Views, layouts, assets e URLs"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii 2.0, controller rendering finds files under `views/{controller}` and layouts under `views/layouts`:"
msgstr "No Yii 2.0, a renderização do controller procura arquivos em `views/{controller}` e layouts em `views/layouts`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return $this->render('view', [\n"
"    'model' => $model,\n"
"]);\n"
msgstr ""
"return $this->render('view', [\n"
"    'model' => $model,\n"
"]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, the template path is explicit in the action:"
msgstr "No Yii3, o caminho do template é explícito na action:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/view', [\n"
"    'post' => $post,\n"
"]);\n"
msgstr ""
"return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/view', [\n"
"    'post' => $post,\n"
"]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "A Yii3 template receives a `Yiisoft\\View\\WebView` instance as `$this`:"
msgstr "Um template do Yii3 recebe uma instância de `Yiisoft\\View\\WebView` como `$this`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\WebView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var WebView $this\n"
" * @var ApplicationParams $applicationParams\n"
" * @var string $title\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"$this->setTitle($title . ' - ' . $applicationParams->name);\n"
"?>\n"
"\n"
"<h1><?= Html::encode($title) ?></h1>\n"
msgstr ""
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\WebView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var WebView $this\n"
" * @var ApplicationParams $applicationParams\n"
" * @var string $title\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"$this->setTitle($title . ' - ' . $applicationParams->name);\n"
"?>\n"
"\n"
"<h1><?= Html::encode($title) ?></h1>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Asset bundles move from `yii\\web\\AssetBundle` to `Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle`:"
msgstr "Os asset bundles passam de `yii\\web\\AssetBundle` para `Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class MainAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets/main';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl/main';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = '@assetsSource/main';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'site.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class MainAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets/main';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl/main';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = '@assetsSource/main';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'site.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Register assets in a layout or view via the asset manager:"
msgstr "Registre os assets em um layout ou view pelo gerenciador de assets:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);\n"
"\n"
"$this->addCssFiles($assetManager->getCssFiles());\n"
"$this->addJsFiles($assetManager->getJsFiles());\n"
msgstr ""
"$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);\n"
"\n"
"$this->addCssFiles($assetManager->getCssFiles());\n"
"$this->addJsFiles($assetManager->getJsFiles());\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace `yii\\helpers\\Url` and `Yii::$app->urlManager` usage with named routes and\n"
"`Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Substitua o uso de `yii\\helpers\\Url` e `Yii::$app->urlManager` por rotas nomeadas e\n"
"`Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface`:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$url = $urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $post->getId()]);\n"
msgstr "$url = $urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $post->getId()]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "See [View](../views/view.md), [Assets](../views/asset.md), [Scripts, styles and metatags](../views/script-style-meta.md), and [Template engines](../views/template-engines.md)."
msgstr "Veja [View](../views/view.md), [Assets](../views/asset.md), [Scripts, estilos e metatags](../views/script-style-meta.md) e [Template engines](../views/template-engines.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Forms and validation"
msgstr "Formulários e validação"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 frequently combines form data, labels, validation, and sometimes persistence in a `yii\\base\\Model` or `yii\\db\\ActiveRecord` class:"
msgstr "O Yii 2.0 frequentemente junta dados do formulário, rótulos, validação e às vezes persistência em uma classe `yii\\base\\Model` ou `yii\\db\\ActiveRecord`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class ContactForm extends \\yii\\base\\Model\n"
"{\n"
"    public $name;\n"
"    public $email;\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['name', 'email'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['email', 'email'],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class ContactForm extends \\yii\\base\\Model\n"
"{\n"
"    public $name;\n"
"    public $email;\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['name', 'email'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['email', 'email'],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 separates these concerns. Use `yiisoft/form-model` for form data and metadata, and `yiisoft/validator` for rules:"
msgstr "O Yii3 separa essas responsabilidades. Use `yiisoft/form-model` para os dados e metadados do formulário, e `yiisoft/validator` para as regras:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "For form rendering, replace `yii\\widgets\\ActiveForm` with `yiisoft/form` fields and form model integration. For input hydration, prefer the form-model and hydrator packages instead of mass-assigning arbitrary request data to persistence objects."
msgstr "Para a renderização de formulários, substitua `yii\\widgets\\ActiveForm` pelos campos do `yiisoft/form` e pela integração com form models. Para a hidratação da entrada, prefira os pacotes de form model e hydrator em vez de atribuir em massa dados arbitrários da requisição a objetos de persistência."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Active Record and persistence"
msgstr "Active Record e persistência"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "There are two common Yii3 choices for code that used Yii 2.0 Active Record classes."
msgstr "Existem duas escolhas comuns no Yii3 para código que usava classes Active Record do Yii 2.0."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The first path is architectural: move business logic to services and domain objects, then use repositories for persistence. This is recommended when the Yii 2.0 model contains validation, form scenarios, authorization checks, mailing, file uploads, and database access in the same class."
msgstr "O primeiro caminho é arquitetural: mova a lógica de negócio para serviços e objetos de domínio e use repositórios para a persistência. Ele é recomendado quando o model do Yii 2.0 contém validação, cenários de formulário, verificações de autorização, envio de e-mails, upload de arquivos e acesso ao banco de dados na mesma classe."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The second path is incremental: represent the database model with [yiisoft/active-record](https://github.com/yiisoft/active-record). This is closer to Yii 2.0 and can be significantly faster when your Active Record classes mostly describe tables and relations."
msgstr "O segundo caminho é incremental: represente o modelo do banco de dados com o [yiisoft/active-record](https://github.com/yiisoft/active-record). Ele é mais próximo do Yii 2.0 e pode ser bem mais rápido quando suas classes Active Record descrevem principalmente tabelas e relações."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0:"
msgstr "Yii 2.0:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class Post extends \\yii\\db\\ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    public static function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['title', 'body'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['title', 'string', 'max' => 255],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class Post extends \\yii\\db\\ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    public static function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['title', 'body'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['title', 'string', 'max' => 255],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 Active Record:"
msgstr "Active Record no Yii3:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\ActiveRecord\\ActiveRecord;\n"
"\n"
"final class Post extends ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    protected int $id;\n"
"    protected string $title;\n"
"    protected string $body;\n"
"\n"
"    public function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getId(): ?int\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->id ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getTitle(): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->title ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function setTitle(string $title): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $this->title = $title;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\ActiveRecord\\ActiveRecord;\n"
"\n"
"final class Post extends ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    protected int $id;\n"
"    protected string $title;\n"
"    protected string $body;\n"
"\n"
"    public function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getId(): ?int\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->id ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getTitle(): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->title ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function setTitle(string $title): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $this->title = $title;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Do not move Yii 2.0 `rules()` directly into the Active Record class. In Yii3, validation belongs to validator rules, form models, command objects, or services:"
msgstr "Não mova o `rules()` do Yii 2.0 diretamente para a classe Active Record. No Yii3, a validação pertence a regras do validator, form models, objetos de comando ou serviços:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormModel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Length;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class PostInput extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    #[Length(max: 255)]\n"
"    public ?string $title = null;\n"
"\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?string $body = null;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormModel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Length;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class PostInput extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    #[Length(max: 255)]\n"
"    public ?string $title = null;\n"
"\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?string $body = null;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Then copy validated data into the record or pass it to an application service:"
msgstr "Depois, copie os dados validados para o registro ou passe-os para um serviço da aplicação:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$post = new Post();\n"
"$post->setTitle($input->title);\n"
"$post->save();\n"
msgstr ""
"$post = new Post();\n"
"$post->setTitle($input->title);\n"
"$post->save();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "When deciding what to reuse, check each Active Record method:"
msgstr "Ao decidir o que reutilizar, verifique cada método do Active Record:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "table mapping and relations can usually move to `yiisoft/active-record`;"
msgstr "o mapeamento de tabelas e as relações geralmente podem ir para o `yiisoft/active-record`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "validation should move to `yiisoft/validator`;"
msgstr "a validação deve ir para o `yiisoft/validator`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "form labels and hints should move to `yiisoft/form-model`;"
msgstr "rótulos e dicas de formulário devem ir para o `yiisoft/form-model`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "search models should become query/data-reader services;"
msgstr "os search models devem virar serviços de consulta/data reader;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "business workflows should become services;"
msgstr "os fluxos de negócio devem virar serviços;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "events should use PSR-14 events or package-specific events;"
msgstr "os eventos devem usar eventos PSR-14 ou eventos específicos de pacotes;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "direct `Yii::$app->db` usage should become injected database dependencies."
msgstr "o uso direto de `Yii::$app->db` deve virar dependências de banco de dados injetadas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 migrations and Yii3 `yiisoft/db-migration` migrations are not compatible. Start a new migration history or create structure dumps for the current schema, then use Yii3 migrations for future schema changes."
msgstr "As migrations do Yii 2.0 e as migrations do `yiisoft/db-migration` do Yii3 não são compatíveis. Comece um novo histórico de migrations ou crie dumps da estrutura do esquema atual, e use migrations do Yii3 para as mudanças futuras no esquema."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 `GridView` is commonly used with `ActiveDataProvider`:"
msgstr "O `GridView` do Yii 2.0 costuma ser usado com `ActiveDataProvider`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use yii\\grid\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget([\n"
"    'dataProvider' => $dataProvider,\n"
"    'filterModel' => $searchModel,\n"
"    'columns' => [\n"
"        'id',\n"
"        'title',\n"
"        'created_at:datetime',\n"
"        ['class' => 'yii\\grid\\ActionColumn'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"]);\n"
msgstr ""
"use yii\\grid\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget([\n"
"    'dataProvider' => $dataProvider,\n"
"    'filterModel' => $searchModel,\n"
"    'columns' => [\n"
"        'id',\n"
"        'title',\n"
"        'created_at:datetime',\n"
"        ['class' => 'yii\\grid\\ActionColumn'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 uses [yiisoft/yii-dataview](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview). It renders data from a data reader and uses fluent widget configuration:"
msgstr "O Yii3 usa o [yiisoft/yii-dataview](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview). Ele renderiza dados a partir de um data reader e usa configuração fluente do widget:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Data\\Reader\\ReadableDataInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\Column\\DataColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\Column\\ActionColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var ReadableDataInterface $dataReader\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title', header: 'Title'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('created_at', header: 'Created'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(),\n"
"    );\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Data\\Reader\\ReadableDataInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\Column\\DataColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\Column\\ActionColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var ReadableDataInterface $dataReader\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title', header: 'Title'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('created_at', header: 'Created'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(),\n"
"    );\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "For sorting, pagination, filtering, and action URLs, wire the widget to Yii Router:"
msgstr "Para ordenação, paginação, filtragem e URLs de actions, conecte o widget ao Yii Router:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlConfig;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlParameterProvider;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->urlParameterProvider(new UrlParameterProvider($currentRoute))\n"
"    ->urlCreator(new UrlCreator($urlGenerator))\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(\n"
"            urlCreator: new ActionColumnUrlCreator($urlGenerator, $currentRoute),\n"
"            urlConfig: new ActionColumnUrlConfig(baseRouteName: 'post'),\n"
"        ),\n"
"    );\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlConfig;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlParameterProvider;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->urlParameterProvider(new UrlParameterProvider($currentRoute))\n"
"    ->urlCreator(new UrlCreator($urlGenerator))\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(\n"
"            urlCreator: new ActionColumnUrlCreator($urlGenerator, $currentRoute),\n"
"            urlConfig: new ActionColumnUrlConfig(baseRouteName: 'post'),\n"
"        ),\n"
"    );\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "A Yii 2.0 search model usually becomes a query service that:"
msgstr "Um search model do Yii 2.0 geralmente vira um serviço de consulta que:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "reads filter and sort parameters from the request;"
msgstr "lê os parâmetros de filtro e ordenação da requisição;"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "validates them with `yiisoft/validator`;"
msgstr "valida esses parâmetros com `yiisoft/validator`;"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "builds a database query or repository query;"
msgstr "monta uma consulta ao banco de dados ou ao repositório;"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "exposes a data reader to GridView."
msgstr "expõe um data reader para o GridView."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "See [Using htmx for partial reloads](../../cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md) for a complete Yii3 GridView workflow and [yii-dataview GridView docs](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview/blob/master/docs/en/guide/gridview.md)."
msgstr "Veja [Usando htmx para recarregamentos parciais](../../cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md) para um fluxo completo de GridView no Yii3 e a [documentação do GridView do yii-dataview](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview/blob/master/docs/en/guide/gridview.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filters, middleware, and access control"
msgstr "Filtros, middleware e controle de acesso"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 controller filters and behaviors usually look like this:"
msgstr "Os filtros e behaviors de controller do Yii 2.0 geralmente são assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function behaviors(): array\n"
"{\n"
"    return [\n"
"        'access' => [\n"
"            'class' => \\yii\\filters\\AccessControl::class,\n"
"            'rules' => [\n"
"                ['allow' => true, 'roles' => ['@']],\n"
"            ],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function behaviors(): array\n"
"{\n"
"    return [\n"
"        'access' => [\n"
"            'class' => \\yii\\filters\\AccessControl::class,\n"
"            'rules' => [\n"
"                ['allow' => true, 'roles' => ['@']],\n"
"            ],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, request processing is middleware-based. Move cross-cutting concerns such as authentication, authorization, body parsing, locale negotiation, CSRF checks, and error handling to middleware or dedicated services. Keep actions focused on the request flow they implement."
msgstr "No Yii3, o processamento das requisições é baseado em middleware. Mova responsabilidades transversais, como autenticação, autorização, parsing do corpo, negociação de idioma, verificação de CSRF e tratamento de erros, para middlewares ou serviços dedicados. Mantenha as actions focadas no fluxo de requisição que elas implementam."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Console commands"
msgstr "Comandos de console"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 console commands extend `yii\\console\\Controller`:"
msgstr "Os comandos de console do Yii 2.0 estendem `yii\\console\\Controller`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class ReportController extends \\yii\\console\\Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionSend(): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return self::EXIT_CODE_NORMAL;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class ReportController extends \\yii\\console\\Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionSend(): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return self::EXIT_CODE_NORMAL;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 console commands are services in `src/Console`:"
msgstr "Os comandos de console do Yii3 são serviços em `src/Console`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace App\\Console;\n"
"\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Attribute\\AsCommand;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Command\\Command;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputInterface;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Output\\OutputInterface;\n"
"\n"
"#[AsCommand(name: 'report/send')]\n"
"final class SendReportCommand extends Command\n"
"{\n"
"    protected function execute(InputInterface $input, OutputInterface $output): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return Command::SUCCESS;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace App\\Console;\n"
"\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Attribute\\AsCommand;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Command\\Command;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputInterface;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Output\\OutputInterface;\n"
"\n"
"#[AsCommand(name: 'report/send')]\n"
"final class SendReportCommand extends Command\n"
"{\n"
"    protected function execute(InputInterface $input, OutputInterface $output): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return Command::SUCCESS;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Move command dependencies to constructor injection and register commands in console configuration."
msgstr "Passe as dependências dos comandos para injeção pelo construtor e registre os comandos na configuração de console."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 REST controllers, serializers, and response formatters do not move directly to Yii3. Start from PSR-7 responses and explicit routing. Build one resource at a time:"
msgstr "Os controllers REST, serializers e formatadores de resposta do Yii 2.0 não passam diretamente para o Yii3. Comece pelas respostas PSR-7 e pelo roteamento explícito. Construa um recurso por vez:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "define routes for collection and item operations;"
msgstr "defina rotas para as operações de coleção e de item;"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "inject request, persistence, serializer, and response factory dependencies;"
msgstr "injete as dependências de requisição, persistência, serializer e response factory;"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "validate input with `yiisoft/validator`;"
msgstr "valide a entrada com `yiisoft/validator`;"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "return JSON responses through Yii3 response helpers or PSR-7 factories;"
msgstr "retorne respostas JSON pelos helpers de resposta do Yii3 ou por factories PSR-7;"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "move authentication and rate limiting to middleware."
msgstr "mova a autenticação e o rate limiting para middlewares."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "See [Response](../runtime/response.md), [Authentication](../security/authentication.md), and [Authorization](../security/authorization.md)."
msgstr "Veja [Resposta](../runtime/response.md), [Autenticação](../security/authentication.md) e [Autorização](../security/authorization.md)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Do not postpone tests until the whole Yii3 application is done. For each new request flow, add:"
msgstr "Não deixe os testes para quando a aplicação Yii3 inteira estiver pronta. Para cada novo fluxo de requisição, adicione:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "unit tests for services and validators;"
msgstr "testes unitários para serviços e validadores;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "functional tests for actions and middleware;"
msgstr "testes funcionais para actions e middlewares;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "end-to-end tests for critical browser flows;"
msgstr "testes end-to-end para os fluxos críticos no navegador;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "static analysis for stricter type checks."
msgstr "análise estática para verificações de tipo mais rigorosas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 code is more explicit, so tests should assert services directly instead of constructing large application component arrays."
msgstr "O código Yii3 é mais explícito, então os testes devem verificar os serviços diretamente, em vez de montar grandes arrays de componentes da aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "See [Testing overview](../testing/overview.md), [Unit tests](../testing/unit.md), [Functional tests](../testing/functional.md), and [End-to-end tests](../testing/end-to-end.md)."
msgstr "Veja [Visão geral dos testes](../testing/overview.md), [Testes unitários](../testing/unit.md), [Testes funcionais](../testing/functional.md) e [Testes end-to-end](../testing/end-to-end.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Refactoring Yii 2.0 code before reusing it"
msgstr "Refatorando o código Yii 2.0 antes de reutilizá-lo"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "These changes are useful even if the old application stays on Yii 2.0 for a while:"
msgstr "Estas mudanças são úteis mesmo que a aplicação antiga continue no Yii 2.0 por um tempo:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Replace `Yii::$app` access in domain code with constructor arguments."
msgstr "Substitua o acesso a `Yii::$app` no código de domínio por argumentos do construtor."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Move queries out of controllers and views into repositories or query services."
msgstr "Tire as consultas dos controllers e views e leve-as para repositórios ou serviços de consulta."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Move business workflows out of Active Record classes."
msgstr "Tire os fluxos de negócio das classes Active Record."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Separate form models from persistence models."
msgstr "Separe os form models dos models de persistência."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Add return types and parameter types."
msgstr "Adicione tipos de retorno e tipos de parâmetros."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Replace route arrays scattered in views with named route constants or helper methods."
msgstr "Substitua arrays de rotas espalhados pelas views por constantes de rotas nomeadas ou métodos helper."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Add tests around each flow before rebuilding it in Yii3."
msgstr "Adicione testes em torno de cada fluxo antes de reconstruí-lo no Yii3."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The less framework state your Yii 2.0 code assumes, the easier it is to understand what should be reused and what should be redesigned for Yii3."
msgstr "Quanto menos estado do framework o seu código Yii 2.0 pressupor, mais fácil fica entender o que deve ser reutilizado e o que deve ser redesenhado para o Yii3."
